; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;9.2&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#0F172A&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot;&gt;1. Pinned KV Prefix Builder&lt;/text&gt;&lt;line x1=&quot;734&quot; y1=&quot;562&quot; x2=&quot;734&quot; y2=&quot;578&quot; stroke=&quot;#D97706&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2&quot;/&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;642&quot; y=&quot;580&quot; width=&quot;184&quot; height=&quot;24&quot; rx=&quot;8&quot; fill=&quot;#FEF3C7&quot; stroke=&quot;#D97706&quot; stroke-width=&quot;1.4&quot;/&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;734&quot; y=&quot;595.8&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;9.2&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#0F172A&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot;&gt;2. BeforeTool Loop Breaker&lt;/text&gt;&lt;line x1=&quot;734&quot; y1=&quot;604&quot; x2=&quot;734&quot; y2=&quot;620&quot; stroke=&quot;#D97706&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2&quot;/&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;642&quot; y=&quot;622&quot; width=&quot;184&quot; height=&quot;24&quot; rx=&quot;8&quot; fill=&quot;#FEF3C7&quot; stroke=&quot;#D97706&quot; stroke-width=&quot;1.4&quot;/&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;734&quot; y=&quot;637.8&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;9.2&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#0F172A&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot;&gt;3. CFG Schema + Model Armor&lt;/text&gt;&lt;line x1=&quot;734&quot; y1=&quot;646&quot; x2=&quot;734&quot; y2=&quot;662&quot; stroke=&quot;#D97706&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2&quot;/&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;648&quot; y=&quot;664&quot; width=&quot;172&quot; height=&quot;24&quot; rx=&quot;8&quot; fill=&quot;#FFFFFF&quot; stroke=&quot;#FCD34D&quot; stroke-width=&quot;1.4&quot;/&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;734&quot; y=&quot;679.8&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;9.2&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#0F172A&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot;&gt;4. OTel GenAI Span Emitter&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;734&quot; y=&quot;720&quot; font-family=&quot;Courier New,monospace&quot; font-size=&quot;8.8&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#92400E&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot;&gt;Inside ADK Runner Process&lt;/text&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;!-- Bottom-Left Legend Note --&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;52&quot; y=&quot;656&quot; width=&quot;276&quot; height=&quot;92&quot; rx=&quot;14&quot; fill=&quot;#F8FAFC&quot; stroke=&quot;#CBD5E1&quot; stroke-width=&quot;1.5&quot;/&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;70&quot; y=&quot;680&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;10.5&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#0F172A&quot;&gt;GOOGLE MAPS RULE FOR DIAGRAMS:&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;70&quot; y=&quot;700&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;9.5&quot; font-weight=&quot;700&quot; fill=&quot;#334155&quot;&gt;• Never mix VP boxes &amp;amp; Python classes on 1 slide&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;70&quot; y=&quot;718&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;9.5&quot; font-weight=&quot;700&quot; fill=&quot;#334155&quot;&gt;• Match C1 / C2 / C3 zoom level to audience&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;70&quot; y=&quot;736&quot; font-family=&quot;Courier New,monospace&quot; font-size=&quot;9&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#2563EB&quot;&gt;1 Zoom Level = Max 5–7 Nodes&lt;/text&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="920" height="1150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

